    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275036</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>え……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wha...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275108</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;！　大丈夫！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt;! Are you okay!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275172</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クルール！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Kuruuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275280</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>魔物を思い通りに操る……！？
そんなことができるのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He can control wild monsters at
will...!? How can he do that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275428</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>以前、&lt;Klarth&gt;さんに
聞いたことがあります</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Klarth&gt; once told us about this!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275428</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>太古の禁呪文を使えば
それが可能だと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>By using ancient forbidden spells,
it's possible to control monsters!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275676</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_013Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ハハハ、
扉の封印は解かれた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hahahaha... I'll break the seal
on that damned door.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275676</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_014Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>この知能の粋の果てで
編み上げた術を使えば、
魔界の民も操れる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>With the results of my research,
I was able to compose a spell
to control a legion of monsters.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275676</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_015Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>この醜い世界は、
私の従僕になった連中の
手にかかり、滅びるんだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This despicable world... Once I
finally have full control of my
servants...all of you will perish!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275784</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_016&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>一体、おまえの目的は何なんだ！
どうしてそんなことを！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just what is your objective!?
Why would you do this!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275868</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_017Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>醜いこの世界を再生する！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>To restore the long lost
shine of this world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275940</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_018&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>待て、ブレイナー！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait,Brainer!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
